{"user": "what could I have done better", "user_ts": "2026-08-04T13:11:38.275081+00:00", "assistant": "You lost mainly because **White got the corners/edges**: White finished with **a1, h1, and a8**, and those made the top/left/bottom edges stable. Your black discs were mostly in the center/right \u2014 many flips, but not permanent enough.\n\nWhat to improve next time:\n\n- **Don\u2019t chase big flips** in the endgame.\n- Before moving, ask: **\u201cDoes this let White take a corner next?\u201d**\n- Avoid moves next to empty corners unless they **force** a good reply.\n- Count 1\u20132 moves ahead: if White gets a corner, can you get another corner or force a pass? If not, avoid it.\n\nSo the big lesson: **mobility + corner denial mattered more than immediate disc count.**", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-04T13:11:50.639425+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-04T13:11:53.354601+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Solution Request"], "consensus": ["Solution Request"], "votes": {"Solution Request": 3}, "confidence": {"Solution Request": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Solution Request"], "llama": ["Solution Request"], "sonnet": ["Solution Request"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant": {"final": ["Direct Instruction"], "consensus": ["Direct Instruction"], "votes": {"Direct Instruction": 3, "Hint": 1}, "confidence": {"Direct Instruction": 1.0, "Hint": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Direct Instruction"], "llama": ["Direct Instruction", "Hint"], "sonnet": ["Direct Instruction"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "General Principle"], "consensus": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "General Principle"], "votes": {"Board Report": 3, "General Principle": 3, "Local Justification": 2}, "confidence": {"Board Report": 1.0, "General